# --- C/C++ 构建产物（CMake / Ninja / MSVC）---
# 根因：示例工程一旦在本地跑过 cmake，就会在 build/ 里生成一堆机器相关的产物，
# 提交上去既没意义、又会让别人的构建缓存打架。
**/build/
**/CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
CMakeConfigureLog.yaml
cmake.check_cache
TargetDirectories.txt
build.ninja
rules.ninja
.ninja_deps
.ninja_log
*.obj
*.o
*.a
*.lib
*.exp
*.ilk
*.iobj
*.ipdb